{{Term/Store|Warm Doublet|Warm Doublets|Series, BotW|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
A Warm Doublet can be acquired from the [[Old Man]] by either gifting him Spicy [[Meat and Seafood Fry]] at the [[Old Man's Cabin]] or the [[Forest of Spirits]], or meeting him at the [[King's Tomb]] at the top of [[Mount Hylia]]. If [[Link]] leaves the [[Great Plateau]] without receiving the Warm Doublet from the Old Man, a [[Stone Chest]] will appear in the Old Man's Cabin containing the Warm Doublet.<ref name="BotW The Old Man's Diary"/> The [[Ventest Clothing Boutique]] in [[Hateno Village]] also sells the Warm Doublet. When worn, it provides Link with one level of [[Cold Resistance]]. While the Warm Doublet can not be upgraded, it can be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

====Dye Options====
{{Dye|BotW|Warm Doublet}}

==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
The Warm Doublet is a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]], and is only obtained by completing the [[Quest]] "[[The King's Secret Technique]]". It can also be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

